// A chain of forward nodes in the source's hop, then one operator over a
// sink in another segment. Each forward node nests the hop's walk one layer
// deeper in the handler of an arriving request (`accept_forward`), about 4.4
// query levels on the pinned toolchain: 31 nodes pass the default limit, and
// under the 256 of the generated crates 60 build where 75 do not. 44 is near
// midway, so a few levels either way keep the test's meaning. An operator's
// call of `next` is boxed, so a chain of operators would not nest.
name = "chain", schema = 1;
source   Front: Ask -> stream Answer;
forward  Step1: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step2: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step3: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step4: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step5: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step6: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step7: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step8: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step9: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step10: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step11: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step12: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step13: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step14: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step15: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step16: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step17: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step18: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step19: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step20: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step21: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step22: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step23: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step24: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step25: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step26: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step27: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step28: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step29: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step30: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step31: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step32: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step33: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step34: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step35: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step36: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step37: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step38: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step39: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step40: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step41: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step42: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step43: Ask -> Ask;
forward  Step44: Ask -> Ask;
operator Pass1: (Ask -> stream Answer) over (Ask -> stream Answer);
sink     Deep: Ask -> stream Answer;
topology: Front => Step1 => Step2 => Step3 => Step4 => Step5 => Step6 => Step7 => Step8 => Step9 => Step10 => Step11 => Step12 => Step13 => Step14 => Step15 => Step16 => Step17 => Step18 => Step19 => Step20 => Step21 => Step22 => Step23 => Step24 => Step25 => Step26 => Step27 => Step28 => Step29 => Step30 => Step31 => Step32 => Step33 => Step34 => Step35 => Step36 => Step37 => Step38 => Step39 => Step40 => Step41 => Step42 => Step43 => Step44 => Pass1 { Deep };
